{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1318560-question-about-arcadia-the-wyld-hunt-art-work","id":1318560,"title":"Question about Arcadia The Wyld Hunt art work.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-14T15:56:41-07:00","id":1318560,"title":"Question about Arcadia The Wyld Hunt art work.","content":"So I'm putting together an Unseelie campaign for Story Tellers Vault, It will be my first with Changeling though I have been story telling it since the 90's in Portland Maine. I wanted to know if there was anyway to get access to the .Tif art from that series to be usable in Story Tellers Vault. I think many individuals would enjoy it. I own the whole set of both minus the one card never printed. Again open to thoughts. Be well <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25339-sebastion","name":"Sebastion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25339_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-14T18:30:08-07:00","id":1318579,"title":"","content":"The art may have reverted to its makers over the years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-14T20:09:14-07:00","id":1318591,"title":"","content":"I was wondering about that. However it's all the same artist as the original core books hence the interest. They have released all the .Tif for free on Story Tellers Vault for use. I just thought It would also be great to use some of that art and get it out there for others to enjoy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25339-sebastion","name":"Sebastion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25339_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-15T10:22:57-07:00","id":1318705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sebastion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1318560-question-about-arcadia-the-wyld-hunt-art-work?p=1318591#post1318591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering about that. However it's all the same artist as the original core books hence the interest. They have released all the .Tif for free on Story Tellers Vault for use. I just thought It would also be great to use some of that art and get it out there for others to enjoy.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That doesn't mean they have the same contracts as they did on the source books, especially since the wyld Hunt game tanked and hasn't seen anything in 22 years?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","